@startuml

title Activity Diagram: UC-05 Manage Cake Design

|Customer|
start
label design_start
:Select "Design" from navigation bar;
:Input design preferences\n(text, flavor, size, colors, occasion);
:Submit design request;

|AI System|
:Receive design preferences;
if (Required parameters complete?) then (Yes)
  if (Valid inputs & available ingredients/themes?) then (Yes)
    :Generate visual preview image(s)\nusing generative-AI model;
  else (No / Unavailable)
    |System|
    :Prompt for clarification or\nsuggest available alternatives;
    detach
  endif
else (No / Incomplete)
  |System|
  :Prompt for missing required parameters;
  detach
endif

|System|
if (AI Generation Successful?) then (Yes)
  :Display generated preview(s) to Customer;
else (No / Failure)
  :Notify Customer & offer to retry or\nconnect with staff for manual consultation;
  detach
endif

|Customer|
repeat
  :Review AI-generated cake design preview(s);
  
  if (User Action?) then (Ask Question)
    :Use AI Chatbot to ask clarifying question;
    |System|
    :Perform Interact with AI Chatbot;
    :Minimize/close chatbot window & keep\nCustomer on current design page;
    |Customer|
  elseif (Request Adjustments) then (Request Changes)
    :Request design adjustments\n(color, decorations, size/tier);
    |AI System|
    :Regenerate updated preview(s)\nbased on requested changes;
    |System|
    :Display updated preview(s);
    |Customer|
  else (Proceed)
    :Select preferred design;
    break
  endif
repeat while (Customer wants to refine design?)

:Submit finalized design for review;

|System|
:Order/Save finalized design;
:Notify Staff/Admin that custom design\nis ready for feasibility review;

|Staff/Admin|
:Review saved design against ingredient\navailability and preparation feasibility;

if (Feasibility Check?) then (Approved)
  |System|
  :Update design status to "Approved";
  :Send notification to Customer;
  |Customer|
  :Select "Add to Cart" / "Order This Design";
  |System|
  :Perform Manage Order use case\n(attach theme, size, flavor, price details);
  stop
else (Declined)
  |System|
  :Update status to "Declined - Design Not Possible";
  :Send notification to Customer with explanation\nand prompt to submit alternative design;
  detach
endif

@enduml
